-- ฟังก์ชันหาเป้าหมายที่ใกล้ที่สุด (เช็ค Whitelist เรียบร้อย)
local function getClosestTarget(partName)
    local target = nil
    local shortestDist = math.huge
    local mousePos = UserInputService:GetMouseLocation()

    for _, plr in pairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
        if plr ~= LocalPlayer then
            local isWhitelisted = table.find(WhitelistTable, plr.Name) ~= nil

            if not isWhitelisted and plr.Character and plr.Character:FindFirstChild(partName) and plr.Character:FindFirstChild("Humanoid") and plr.Character.Humanoid.Health > 0 then
                local part = plr.Character[partName]
                local screenPos, onScreen = Camera:WorldToViewportPoint(part.Position)
                if onScreen then
                    local dist = (Vector2.new(screenPos.X, screenPos.Y) - mousePos).Magnitude
                    if dist < shortestDist then
                        shortestDist = dist
                        target = part
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    return target
end

